    "message": "Add \"internal data\" to IMGT germline dbs\n\ninstall_IMGT_germline_db() now computes and adds \"internal data\" to\nthe installed db (only when 'tcr.db=FALSE' at the moment). Not documented\nyet. Also needs some extensive testing.\n\nThis new feature relies on compute_imgt_intdata(), a low-level utility\nto compute IgBLAST internal data for a set of germline V gene allele\ngapped sequences.\n",
    "time": 1770667114
  },
